{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "00bdfce4c1c3179836a7aacd7eb8e310dcb5b14152fc8f2040398b644236b43e", "ja": "ワン、ツー、ワン、ツー。ステップして……、\nターンでキメて……いぇいっ！", "zh": "1、2、1、2。踏一步……\n转个圈再摆姿势……耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1001_p", "source_sha256": "17a08cc33b9bc989876f987df2a1c83a12498865715fa2c79c3472b96bc4a7d8", "ja": "あれ？　やよい、こんなところで\nダンスの練習か？", "zh": "咦？\n弥生，你在这里练习舞步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "49d83b4d9af5fa8b754e4b6d219e8d658294f87fcf56067a9bb0d98d16334445", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\n練習じゃないんですけど～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n其实不是练习啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "e2277eb619792bcec4e177e3b9518bc53ccf0ca446826fe3370217a037b5d6f4", "ja": "この衣装着たら、なんだかウキウキして、\nつい……えへへっ。", "zh": "只是穿上这套服装以后突然觉得好兴奋，\n忍不住就……嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1004_p", "source_sha256": "da38b9383353157365fd5063efb0ce5d5905c9e0e7106d5cb85361df35099c2e", "ja": "それで踊っちゃってたのか。ずいぶん衣装のこと、\n気に入ってもらえたみたいだな。", "zh": "所以才会跳起舞来吗？\n看来你很喜欢那套服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "c99c374fe4735848a3d83fa73fc065c0374af7a10e03d856b5c13dd252916134", "ja": "はい！　とーっても可愛くって、\n私、大好きです！", "zh": "是啊！这套服装非～常可爱，\n我好喜欢喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "c8e5346ba692badd18f2606703ae0e9662ec2f6faf9eb98b136d5b4729127eae", "ja": "それに、ふわふわで暖かいですし、\n靴なんて、氷の上でもピタってして滑らないんですよ！", "zh": "而且穿起来软绵绵的很暖和，\n鞋子也是，就算踩在冰上也稳稳的不会滑倒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8592957c18edf6d6270c994bfab2267f6537305afa797eb01d12c7adb95dd36f", "ja": "それは良かった。リンクの上でライブするのが\n決まっていたから……。", "zh": "那真是太好了。\n因为演唱会要在溜冰场上举办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1853031caafc80550904286c999c97494a987c969eeb4dba7f3a8541a5256e9f", "ja": "衣装を作るときに、青羽さんが工夫してくれたんだ。\nできるだけ冷えないように、とか。", "zh": "所以制作服装时，有请青羽小姐多下点工夫，\n像是尽量做得保暖一点之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "5bc1b45671f7b9e05f1ac233b66212efd73c2cc0219a232c7ec3b3e9ecc4c78a", "ja": "そうだったんですか！\nじゃあ私、美咲さんにもお礼を言わなくちゃっ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊！\n那我得去向美咲姊姊道谢才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5a623b52526f7f5311311a2c30e3d7e19820adc2de215c018a43adc61817fffd", "ja": "ああ、そうするといいよ。", "zh": "嗯，找时间向她道谢吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "b4c268d21432c4a04d269c92f27016dd36f6e29904b3b8557c710d6e2d8d19a4", "ja": "はい！　それと～、あ！\nでも……うう……。", "zh": "好的！还有～\n啊！可是……唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "553a51b3650e5b0ef3c1eb01c81336f497f936b872f8caf48ef3fbdf8380993b", "ja": "どうした、やよい？\nなにか気になることでもあるのか？", "zh": "怎么啦，弥生？\n有什么介意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "c68b833f67827ec6b7fda8b4a61bc8d7efdad1ff8d33f5693c7dcfd0d4da3e63", "ja": "えっと……。私、美咲さんにお裁縫を\n教えてもらいたいなーって……。", "zh": "那个……\n我想要请美咲姊姊教我裁缝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "686f3407895c329a1e046f646ea4ddd89dd23747d6c3131ffe5d8e3a05a86bef", "ja": "この衣装みたいに工夫したら、\n妹や弟達の冬用の服も、きっと暖かくなりますよね？", "zh": "要是能学会她在这套服装上所下的工夫，\n我也能把弟妹们的冬天衣物改得更保暖吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "28921db29ce810c6d9c8c1d805ba253625d800511706cb618795a86a7d74b262", "ja": "でも、そんなの、美咲さんのお仕事の\n邪魔になっちゃうかなーって……。", "zh": "可是，\n不知道这样会不会打扰美咲姊姊工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "93e2e002085f7fbf4a423d4ce72c93c21802763e7bbb40e83ae1ddf98264527f", "ja": "喜びそうな気もするけど……\nそうだ、こうしたらいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我倒觉得她会很乐意教你……\n对了，不如这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cd9162737ea9fd671eeceeba5473de4fcca5591b53e17805c96640a8517f2513", "ja": "青羽さんの衣装作りのお手伝いをしながら、\n教えてもらうとか。", "zh": "你一边帮忙青羽小姐做服装，\n一边请她教你如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "a4089bb12b9df93f4a4609a9e18a36fdad5f7853f5ab1c3ca89de0f1796a2ac3", "ja": "そっか……そうですよねっ！\nお手伝いなら、きっと邪魔じゃないですよねっ！", "zh": "对耶……说得也是！\n只要帮忙做服装，就不会打扰她工作了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "41d0843def5227cc7b4b81800e56a546f437045e4b4cd1b6d72e6ae05240726c", "ja": "うっうー！　私、今から美咲さんに、\nお手伝いさせてくださいってお願いしてきまーす！", "zh": "呜呜──！\n我马上去请美咲姊姊让我帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e158a3d0d68c1127a603ff56b2e43f2b72f90a520281eae662f94d346422ddc8", "ja": "（嬉しそうに、飛び出していった。まあ、やよいなら\n青羽さんの邪魔になることはしないだろうし……）", "zh": "（弥生开心地跑出去了。\n也好，弥生她应该不会妨碍青羽小姐工作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0094_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ed1ff0f5582d00da5947195ee7b56c9bb2711e017b7a6e548ac08801295f90e8", "ja": "（青羽さんも、自分の作った衣装を、あんなに喜んで\nもらえるのは嬉しいだろうから、良かったかな）", "zh": "（而青羽小姐要是知道弥生这么喜欢她做的服装，\n一定会很开心才对，所以这也算好事一桩吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
